needed to determine these conditional distributions. We need to know all forward smiles, that is, the future prices of
all vanilla options as seen from all possible states of the world.
1.7.3
The relation between local and implied volatility
There is a link between the local volatility and the implied volatility. Berestycki et al.
[2002] showed that when
